INSERT INTO activities (id,date,description,person) VALUES (238,'2026-08-03','Continued working on the LinkedCare Help Center (CMS) by creating user guides for Ward Management (Wards, Ward Rooms, Bed Types & Beds), Adding Doctors & License Allocation, and Adding Rooms, including step-by-step instructions and key notes to assist administrators with the initial LinkedCare setup.','Sayan');
INSERT INTO activities (id,date,description,person) VALUES (239,'2026-08-04','Continued working on the LinkedCare Help Center (CMS) by creating comprehensive user guides for Prescription Template Setup, Shifts Configuration, ADT Tasks, Surgery Types, Complications, and Pre-Operative Checklists. The guides include detailed step-by-step instructions, configuration details, prerequisites, important notes, and usage information to help clinic administrators configure IPD and OT modules, customize prescription templates, and streamline hospital setup.','Sayan');
INSERT INTO activities (id,date,description,person) VALUES (240,'2026-08-04','Connected with Mr. Khagendra Dadsena from Sai Care Multispeciality Hospital regarding software linkage. He informed that they were occupied with patient consultations and requested to reconnect tomorrow morning to continue the process.','Sayan');
INSERT INTO activities (id,date,description,person) VALUES (241,'2026-08-05','Connected with Mr. Khagendra Dadsena and Dr. Nabin Tandi from Sai Care Multispeciality Hospital, completed the software linkage using the Bridge ID on NHPR and shared the zoho onboarding form for further process. Also doctor had some doubt related to PMJAY so answered his queries related to that','Sayan');
INSERT INTO activities (id,date,description,person) VALUES (242,'2026-08-05','Connected with Ms Kashish from Shiv Shakti Hospital as she was facing issue in creating appointment of ABHA patient due to mobile number was not updated, connected with her on anydesk and guided her steps by steps to update the mobile number Also there was issue in her account related to licensing, discussed the issue with Varun sir and resolved the issue.','Sayan');
INSERT INTO activities (id,date,description,person) VALUES (243,'2026-08-05','Re-evaluated the recently closed tickets on the pre-release version of the LinkedCare Mobile Application to verify the implemented fixes. During validation, identified that the ticket related to the Pharmacy module becoming unresponsive was still reproducible and reopened it with the latest observations for further investigation.','Sayan');
INSERT INTO activities (id,date,description,person) VALUES (244,'2026-08-06','Connected with Mr. Khagendra Dadsena from Sai Care Multispeciality Hospital to verify and confirm the doctors'' names and mobile numbers. Subsequently completed the backend setup in LIAMP by creating the hospital, adding the required SKU, configuring doctor profiles, creating beds, enabling the required modules, integrating ABHA, enabling GPE, and creating the required SOAP components for the doctor.','Sayan');
INSERT INTO activities (id,date,description,person) VALUES (245,'2026-08-06','Connected with Ms. Roshani and Mr. Neeraj Sahu from Sai Care Multispeciality Hospital and conducted Clinic Admin, Assistant, and Doctor training. The training included configuration of wards, ward rooms, bed types, beds, shifts, and staff, assisted with the first-time login for doctors and staff using the default password, and a complete walkthrough of the patient workflow, including patient registration, appointment creation, consultation, IPD admission, and patient discharge.','Sayan');
INSERT INTO activities (id,date,description,person) VALUES (246,'2026-08-06','3. Connected with Varun Sir to understand the upcoming enhancements planned for the OT Module and OPD Billing. Also discussed and clarified queries related to the quotation.','Sayan');
INSERT INTO activities (id,date,description,person) VALUES (247,'2026-08-07','Connected with Ms. Roshani from Sai Care Hospital and provided Billing Head and Nurse training. Also conducted a complete walkthrough of the OPD and IPD workflows, including patient creation from the Assistant Dashboard, doctor assignment, starting consultation from the Doctor Dashboard, using Disposition (Admit), entering the required details, finalizing and saving prescriptions, creating patient bills, and managing patients through the Nurse Module. Additionally, configured their prescription template as per the hospital''s requirements.','Sayan');
INSERT INTO activities (id,date,description,person) VALUES (248,'2026-08-07','Connected with Dr. Prakhar and initiated the product demo; however, he was primarily interested in the possibility of backdated patient admission rather than the overall demo. Discussed the requirement with Varun Sir and conveyed to Dr. Prakhar that backdated admission is not supported in LinkedCare and will not be provided as a feature in the future. He informed that he would discuss the matter internally and confirm his decision.','Sayan');
INSERT INTO activities (id,date,description,person) VALUES (249,'2026-08-08','Completed the backend setup, added the doctor, integrated ABHA, and enabled the required modules. Separately connected with Dr. Jaydip for the frontend setup, including wards, ward rooms, beds, staff, shifts, and prescription template configuration. Assisted with first-time login and provided Assistant and Doctor dashboard training. Also guided him on filling the opening stock file for the pharmacy setup.','Sayan');
INSERT INTO activities (id,date,description,person) VALUES (250,'2026-08-10','Tested the LinkedCare web and mobile applications and identified two issues. First, in the IPD section, the IPD Days displayed under Patient Summary → Current IPD is incorrect, as it is counting the treatment duration instead of the total number of days since the patient’s admission. Second, for some patients, the Age field is appearing blank on the generated prescription. Both issues were discussed and reported to Varun Sir for further review.','Sayan');
